570\/8280\/6344\/files\/Q1S_Pro_2.0_Merach_Magnetisches_Rudergerat.pdf?v=1734510063\">Download-Anleitung &lt;&lt;<\/a><\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["item_VcpLPc","item_NhAFCk","item_Nxwg4T","item_Pgrxki","item_KG8pzh"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"Product Specification","content":"<p>Here are the product details. If you need further information, please do not hesitate to contact us.<br\/><br\/>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info.uk@merachfit.com\" title=\"mailto:info.uk@merachfit.com\">info.uk@merachfit.com<\/a><\/p>","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"start","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"faq_M7BAfh":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_imyDjA":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"1. Is the Merach R15 magnetic rowing machine suitable for beginners?","content":"<p>Yes. With 16 adjustable resistance levels, the Merach R15 is suitable for both beginners and more experienced users. You can start with low resistance and gradually increase the intensity as your fitness improves.<\/p>"}},"item_Lt8P4L":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"2. How stable is the Merach R15 during workouts?","content":"<p>The Merach R15 is designed to support a maximum user weight of up to 160 kg. Its durable frame and high-quality rail system provide excellent stability, ensuring safe and steady workouts even during more intense rowing sessions.<\/p>"}},"item_LYPaJA":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"3. Can I use my smartphone or tablet while training?","content":"<p>Yes. The Merach R15 includes an adjustable device holder, allowing you to place your smartphone or tablet securely. This lets you follow workout programmes, watch videos, or track training data through apps while exercising.<\/p>"}},"item_Qd8bk8":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"4. Is the Merach R15 suitable for regular home workouts?","content":"<p>Yes. The machine is designed specifically for regular home use. Its magnetic resistance system provides a smooth and consistent rowing motion while also being durable and low maintenance.<\/p>"}},"item_6e3P8P":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"5. What are the advantages of a magnetic rowing machine compared with other resistance systems?","content":"<p>Magnetic rowing machines like the Merach R15 offer quiet and smooth resistance, making them ideal for home workouts. Compared with water or air resistance machines, they generally require less maintenance and provide a more consistent training experience.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_imyDjA","item_Lt8P4L","item_LYPaJA","item_Qd8bk8","item_6e3P8P"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"FAQ","content":"","team_avatar_width":160,"support_hours":"","answer_time":"","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"specification_table_N4iPYp":{"type":"specification-table","blocks":{"row_FijwjU":{"type":"row","settings":{"heading":"Steuerelemente und Funktionen","value":"<p>111<\/p>"}},"row_jqYT34":{"type":"row","settings":{"heading":"Abmessungen der Maschine","value":"<p>Value 2<\/p>"}},"row_zdjWzD":{"type":"row","settings":{"heading":"Garantie","value":"<ul><li>Rahmen: 12 Monate<\/li><li>Motor: 12 Monate<\/li><li>Teile: 12 Monate<\/li><li>Verschleißteile: 12 Monate<\/li><li>Kosmetische Teile: 90 Tage<\/li><li>Gewerbliche Nutzung: Nicht verfügbar, nur für den privaten Gebrauch.<\/li><\/ul>"}}},"block_order":["row_FijwjU","row_jqYT34","row_zdjWzD"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"","content":"<p>Hier finden Sie die Details zum Produkt. Sollten Sie weitere Informationen benötigen, zögern Sie bitte nicht, uns zu kontaktieren.<\/p><p